            "meaning": "激情"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "that we are becoming increasingly less dependent on specialized labour.",
      "translation": "以至于我们越来越少地依赖专业劳动。",
