          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "No one can plead ignorance of a subject any longer, for there are countless do-it-yourself publications.",
      "translation": "由于有无数的“自己动手”出版物，再也没有人可以借口对某一学科一无所知了。",
