      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Such things provide an excellent outlet for pent up creative energy, but unfortunately not all of us are born handymen.",
      "translation": "这些事情为被压抑的创造力提供了一个极好的排遣渠道，但遗憾的是，并不是我们所有人都是天生的能工巧匠。",
